: hand-written from the Anthropic web search tool and streaming docs (platform.claude.com, read 2026-11-09): the query streams as input_json_delta on a server_tool_use block, the result block arrives whole in content_block_start, citations stream as citations_delta between text deltas, and message_delta usage carries server_tool_use.web_search_requests; a thinking block comes first as with display "omitted"

